      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "langmem_native.py   THE MANAGER \u00b7 Job 1    3 sentences in, 2 memories out\nmem0_native.py      THE MANAGER \u00b7 Jobs 1+2  add/update/del/noop, superseded\nzep_native.py       THE STORE \u00b7 graph       INVALID from <timestamp>\nsupabase_native.py  THE STORE \u00b7 vector      and NO manager at all\ntiny_memory_agent.py  40 lines, no tools \u2014 the store with nothing around it",
